\p{The upper drawing is the stable node of
\citet{Figure 4.16, p. 105}{izhikevich2007dynamical},
with eigenvalues #{-1} and #{-3}. The lower drawing is the saddle of
\citet{Figure 4.17, p. 105}{izhikevich2007dynamical},
with eigenvalues #{1} and #{-1}. The filled circle marks the stable
node and the open circle marks the saddle.}
